{"school":{"dbn":"31R048","name":"P.S. 048 William G. Wilcox","boro":"Staten Island","district":"31","district_label":"District 31","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"K-8","grades":"K to 8","status":"open","enrollment":962,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"1050 TARGEE STREET, STATEN ISLAND, NY 10304","phone":"718-727-6040","website":"psis48.echalksites.com/","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/72415","accessibility":"Fully Accessible","overview":"PS/IS 48 is a PreK-8 school located in the Concord section of Staten Island.  We are dedicated to the belief that all students can meet high standards of excellence.  We are a learning community dedicated to creativity, academic excellence and intellectual curiosity, with the aim of developing life-long learners and engaged students.  We are committed to the intellectual, artistic, moral, emotional, social and physical development of each child.  At PS/IS 48, \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009cWe are more than a school, we are a family.\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009d  At our Atlas Academy Middle School,  our students have the opportunity to take regent\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s level courses in American History and Algebra in 8th grade. All students are scheduled for Spanish and take the Spanish Language Proficiency.  We offer a variety of elective courses such as band, music, art, dance, STEM, economics and law.  We believe in honoring the student voice through a variety of student- led clubs and restorative circles.  Our after school programs include CHAMPS, Compass and SONYC through NYCID and paid after-care.","start_time":"8:00am","end_time":"2:20pm","languages":null,"subway":null,"bus":"S53, S74, S76, S84, S86, S93, SIM15, SIM33C, SIM35, SIM3C","shared_building":"1","neighborhood":"Grasmere - Concord","latitude":40.602862,"longitude":-74.0